Z||000009||BENGAL4||04-13-2000||09:18 AM||||Doughboy,<P>I found the engine here in Cincinnati. They said they could find one and it would be around $3,000.00 canadian. I am getting it shipped thru my old comapny(Lesson don't burn bridges when you leave a job). They get a great rate and I wont have to pay a customs broker. As for Toronto, we checked out the Yorkdale mall while we were there. Huge place. Have to watch where you walk because people there will run you over. I guess the pace is much slower in Cincy, but that's why I stay and love it here.||||reg||10
