Z||000011||BENGAL4||04-13-2000||09:18 PM||||Doughboy,<P>The engine was $1500.00 US. The cost for the swap is approx $5000.00 US. They are also upgrading my suspension with springs, poly-bushings, front & rear swaybars and whatever else I need. The cost of the swap includes Centerforce dual friction clutch assy, custom flywheel, Holley fuel pump, custom wiring harness and other odds and ends. In all it will end up costing $8000.00 US. I know that is alot of cash but, I would rather have an almost new Fiero than any other car out there. <BR>||||reg||1
